{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onPictureInPictureChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handler","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The adapter MUST also invoke the handler once, synchronously or on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next main-queue turn, with the CURRENT state at install time. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adapter outlives the SDK session (one player, many sessions), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition that lands between sessions — the previous session’s window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closing late, the next one not yet initialized — is otherwise consumed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the adapter’s own change-dedup with nobody listening, and the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session starts believing the window is closed while the player is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting in it (measured on the iOS e2e fleet, catalog-pip"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PIP-ENTER-DURING-* @ 0.50.0-beta.506). The renderer’s dedup makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install-time delivery idempotent, so adapters need not special-case"},{"type":"text","tex